        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-EDGE-PULL-MB\"><b>Laurey Edge Pull in Matte Black</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Matte Black Edge Pull installs with a low profile that will add a modern touch to your kitchen. The Edge Pull in Matte Black can be mounted horizontally or vertically for use on kitchen cabinet doors or drawers. Choose from an array of sizes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Matte Black Cabinet Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Package with 2 Self Tap Screws - 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-96720:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96220:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96320:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96420:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 8-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96520:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
